   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "-> reply: yes, a Space workbench, one level above Project:\n1  each Project folds open [-]\n2  inside it, its Themes, each a row of Block cards\n3  filter by Block kind: all · task · paper · discovery · design\n4  a Block card opens that Block's workbench, /w/<block>\n\ntoday: servers/space-home already finds every Board below the\nroot and groups them by Project (project.yaml), read-only.\nmissing: Themes inside a Project, the kind filter, the folds,\nand Spaces with a Runs panel, so it is a Home, not a workbench.\ndrawn: the Space level, left of Project.\n\n? Home grows into the Space workbench, or a new one beside it",
   "originalText": "-> reply: yes, a Space workbench, one level above Project:\n1  each Project folds open [-]\n2  inside it, its Themes, each a row of Block cards\n3  filter by Block kind: all · task · paper · discovery · design\n4  a Block card opens that Block's workbench, /w/<block>\n\ntoday: servers/space-home already finds every Board below the\nroot and groups them by Project (project.yaml), read-only.\nmissing: Themes inside a Project, the kind filter, the folds,\nand Spaces with a Runs panel, so it is a Home, not a workbench.\ndrawn: the Space level, left of Project.\n\n? Home grows into the Space workbench, or a new one beside it",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-7e24beb62ebb",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3080,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 642.4000000000001,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
